<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'My dashboard' }) %>
<%- include('../partials/student-nav', { active: 'dashboard' }) %>
<main class="container app-container page-shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">YOUR STUDY SPACE</p><h1 class="page-title">Welcome back, <%= user.name.split(' ')[0] %>.</h1><p class="page-lede">A steady plan is a strong start. Find the information you need and keep your next steps in view.</p>
  <% if (!profile) { %><section class="panel p-4 p-lg-5 my-4 d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-md-center justify-content-between gap-3"><div><span class="status-pill">ONE QUICK FIRST STEP</span><h2 class="panel-heading h3 mt-3">Add your academic profile</h2><p class="text-secondary mb-0">Your profile helps compare your results with documented requirements. You can browse concours without it.</p></div><a href="/student/profile/create" class="btn btn-forest flex-shrink-0">Complete my profile <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section><% } else { %><section class="notice-callout my-4"><strong>Your profile is ready.</strong> Use it to compare your academic details with published requirements. Results are guidance only.</section><% } %>
  <div class="row g-3 mt-2">
    <div class="col-md-6"><a class="panel quick-link d-block p-4 h-100 text-decoration-none" href="/student/opportunities"><span class="feature-icon">⌕</span><h2 class="panel-heading h4 mt-3">Find a concours</h2><p class="text-secondary mb-3">Explore published information, key dates and official sources.</p><span class="text-forest fw-semibold small">Browse listings →</span></a></div>
    <div class="col-md-6"><a class="panel quick-link d-block p-4 h-100 text-decoration-none" href="/student/saved-opportunities"><span class="feature-icon">☆</span><h2 class="panel-heading h4 mt-3">Your saved list</h2><p class="text-secondary mb-3">Keep the opportunities you’re considering together.</p><span class="text-forest fw-semibold small">View saved →</span></a></div>
    <div class="col-md-6"><a class="panel quick-link d-block p-4 h-100 text-decoration-none" href="/student/profile"><span class="feature-icon">◎</span><h2 class="panel-heading h4 mt-3">Academic profile</h2><p class="text-secondary mb-3">Keep your background and results up to date.</p><span class="text-forest fw-semibold small">View profile →</span></a></div>
    <div class="col-md-6"><div class="panel p-4 h-100"><span class="feature-icon">✦</span><h2 class="panel-heading h4 mt-3">Study rhythm</h2><p class="text-secondary mb-0">Set a manageable weekly goal and focus on one session at a time. Small, regular study sessions add up.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="notice-callout mt-4"><strong>Applications:</strong> ConcoursHub does not accept or process applications. Follow the official institution source for application instructions and decisions.</div>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
